Vorbis codebook libraries (crates/p4kx-audio/codebooks)
--------------------------------------------------------

packed_codebooks.bin and packed_codebooks_aoTuV_603.bin come unchanged from ww2ogg by Adam
Gashlin (hcs), https://github.com/hcs64/ww2ogg. They hold the codebooks of the Vorbis reference
encoder libvorbis by the Xiph.org Foundation and of the aoTuV Beta 6.03 encoder by Aoyumi, which
is based on libvorbis and released under the same licence, in the packed form Wwise refers to.
P4K-Extractor uses them to rebuild the Vorbis headers of Wwise sounds.

